OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 21, dies in crash following
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police forces are being
OL,7,Finvestigated after a 21-year-old woman
OL,8,Fdied in a crash following a police
OL,9,Fpursuit in Staffordshire.
OL,11,FThe front-seat passenger of a Seat
OL,12,FIbiza, which had been followed by
OL,13,Fofficers, died at the scene of the
OL,14,Fcrash in Rugeley Road, Hednesford, just
OL,15,Fafter 23:00 GMT on Friday,
OL,16,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,18,FThe force said the Seat collided with a
OL,19,FVauxhall Astra, which was also being
OL,20,Fdriven by a member of the public, after
OL,21,Fthe police pursuit.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
